```

### Step 5.2 — Point the VPC to a single NAT in `terraform/main.tf`
Find `module "vpc"` and make it:
```hcl
module "vpc" {
  source = "./modules/vpc"

  vpc_cidr           = var.vpc_cidr
  availability_zones = ["us-east-1a", "us-east-1b"]
  environment        = var.environment
  enable_nat_gateway = true
  single_nat_gateway = true   # ONE NAT for all AZs — saves ~$64/mo
}
```

### Step 5.3 — Fix the budget start date in `terraform/main.tf`
