### Step 5.4 — Disable ElastiCache & CUR to protect budget
In `terraform/main.tf`, the CUR report + its S3 bucket are heavy and QuickSight/Redshift-tied. Comment out (or delete) these resources for the capstone: `aws_cur_report_definition`, `aws_s3_bucket.cost_reports`, `aws_s3_bucket_policy.cost_reports_policy`, `data.aws_iam_policy_document.cost_reports_policy`, and the `cost_report_bucket` output. You'll track cost with **AWS Budgets + Infracost** instead (Phase 10).

