## 🆘 Troubleshooting Quick Reference

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| `terraform init` fails on `./modules/*` | modules missing | You created them in Phase 5.6/5.7 |
| `terraform init` backend error | bucket name taken | Use `enterprise-devops-tfstate-<account-id>` |
| CI: "no package.json" | wrong dir | `working-directory: app/src` (Phase 7.2) |
| Docker build fails at `npm run test` | old Dockerfile | Use Phase 3.1 Dockerfile |
| `kubectl set image` "not found" | no Deployment | Deploy via Helm (Phase 6) |
| Tests fail on `toBeOneOf` | jest-extended missing | Phase 2.1–2.2 |
| HPA shows `<unknown>` | metrics-server missing | Phase 6.1 |
| Pods `Pending` | SPOT capacity / requests too big | lower requests or raise `max_size` |
| ALB has no address | LB controller missing/misconfigured | Phase 6.1; check its pod logs in `kube-system` |
| Bill climbing | cluster left running | `./scripts/teardown.sh` |

